<title>USA: Macheezmo Mouse says CEO Bennett to leave.</title>
<headline>Macheezmo Mouse says CEO Bennett to leave.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macheezmo Mouse Restaurants Inc said on Friday that David Bennett is relinquishing his positions as president and chief executive of the company for personal reasons that require him to reside in another part of the country.</p>
<p>Bennett will remain on the board and executive committee, the company said.</p>
<p>It said that William Tiger Warren, chairman of the board, will take over Bennett's responsibilities on an interim basis.</p>
</text>
